<p>Hi <%= @preferred_name %>,</p>

<p><%= @event_name %> has moved to <strong><%= @event_dates %></strong>. Your waiver showed the old dates, so we've replaced it with an updated copy, and we need you to sign it again.</p>

<p style="margin: 24px 0;">
  <%= mail_button "Sign Your Updated Waiver", @waiver_link %>
</p>

<% if @participant_event.requires_guardian? %>
<p>Once you've signed, we'll send it to your parent/guardian for their signature.</p>
<% end %>

<p>If you have any questions, reach out to <%= mail_to @support_email %>.</p>
